<title>USA: MBIA qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>MBIA qualifies three muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following three municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Anamosa Community School District, Iowa, $6.1 million general obligation school bonds.</p>
<p>--Roslyn Union Free School District, N.Y., $10.9 million school bonds.</p>
<p>--Shaler Area School District, Pa., $9.995 million GOs, under MBIA's alternate bid program.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
